    "description": "Helped develop 3 websites to explore different theories involving gaming:\n\nUnexceptionalNet - an augmented reality game that used GPS and cellphones to allow players to interact in the virtual world by requiring players to physically move to an intended destination as well and spiritually navigate their avatar to the same in game location.\n\nUC Game Lab - a collaboration infrastructure that allowed academic scholars from across the nation to ubiquitously interact and discuss Game Theory using various Web 2.0 frameworks (telecomunications, blogging, wikis, RSS, etc) such that information was easily assessable.\n\nDinoquest Online - a edutainment game that teaches kids about anatomy using dinosaurs.  The online website connected with on-site physical attraction such that rewards earned on site could be redeemed online and players needed to complete both the online and on-site attractions to grasp the full experience of Dinoquest.",
